{"page": 1408, "total_pages": 1554, "total": 77662, "skills": [{"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781003345522, "description": "群成员昵称映射分析。基于 DMWork/OpenClaw 权威成员字段(robot/owner_uid)+ 主动拉取历史消息，为群 @ 列表每个成员建立带置信度、证据、冲突的称呼映射，支持增量 upsert 合并。当需要识别群内成员的昵称/花名/简称/常用称呼/机器人别名，或维护 mention 映射表时使用。", "description_zh": "群成员昵称映射分析：依据 DMWork/OpenClaw 的 robot/owner_uid 字段和主动拉取的历史消息，为群里 @ 列表的每位成员构建带置信度、证据、冲突的称呼映射，支持增量 upsert 合并。用于识别并维护成员的昵称、花名、简称、常用称呼或机器人别名。", "downloads": 108, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/lovejing0306/octo-mention", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 1, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": 1781003345637, "name": "Octo Mention", "ownerName": "lovejing0306", "score": 15789.473684210525, "slug": "octo-mention", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582992414, "upstream_owner_login": "lovejing0306", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/lovejing0306/octo-mention", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779597370964, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 108, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/waste-sorting-assistant", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/e9a58ede-ead5-43fd-9523-d1ba7f1b78cd.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "垃圾分类助手", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 17142.85714285714, "slug": "waste-sorting-assistant", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582992231, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779096899255, "description": "Diagnose and fix OpenClaw gateway not starting or web UI not accessible on Windows, especially the Chinese username encoding bug in gateway.cmd which causes the gateway to fail silently. Also creates auto-start scheduled task for maintenance-free operation. Triggers on: OpenClaw web page not loading, gateway not starting, 无法打开OpenClaw网页, gateway启动失败, 中文路径乱码, OpenClaw服务未运行, OpenClaw won't load, OpenClaw gateway timeout, port 18789 not responding, gateway token missing. See references/trigger-phrases-en.md for full English trigger list.", "description_zh": ">> 自动诊断并修复 OpenClaw 网关无法启动、网页无法访问的问题，专治中文 Windows 用户名路径乱码导致的静默启动失败，并支持一键配置开机自启。\n\n-----------------------------\n\n### 完整介绍\n\n# 🔧 OpenClaw Gateway Fixer\n\n**让 OpenClaw 网页永远打得开。**\n\n------------------------------------------\n\n## 你遇到过这些问题吗？\n\n- OpenClaw 网页突然打不开，一片空白或连接超时？\n- 双点 `gateway.cmd`，什么都没发生，没有任何错误提示？\n- 系统更新或重装后，OpenClaw 彻底无法启动？\n- 浏览器提示「网关令牌缺失 (gateway token missing)」，但 token 明明是对的？\n\n**`openclaw-gateway-fixer` 一键帮你搞定。**\n\n-------------------------------------------\n\n## ✅ 核心功能\n\n| 功能 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 🔍 一键全面诊断 | 6 项自动检查：进程状态、端口监听、gateway.cmd 编码、Node.js 路径、openclaw.json 配置、HTTP 响应 |\n| 🛠️ 自动修复中文乱码 | 识别并修复 Windows 中文用户名（如 `吴清能`）在 `gateway.cmd` 中被错误编码为乱码（`鍚存竻鑳絓`）的问题 |\n| 🚀 绕过故障脚本直接启动 | 当 `gateway.cmd` 彻底损坏时，直接调用 Node.js 启动网关，无需手动修改任何文件 |\n| 🔇 生成静默启动脚本 | 生成 `.vbs` 启动脚本，运行时不弹黑色 CMD 窗口，体验丝滑 |\n| 🔄 配置开机自动启动 | 一键创建 Windows 任务计划，登录后自动延迟 15 秒启动网关，重启电脑无需任何手动操作 |\n\n--------------------------------\n\n## 🎯 适用人群\n\n- 使用 **中文 Windows 用户名** 的 OpenClaw 用户（问题高发群体）\n- 经常遇到 OpenClaw 网页打不开的 AI 开发者\n- 希望 OpenClaw 开机**零维护自动运行**的用户\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 安装使用\n\n**安装技能（WorkBuddy）：**\n```\n/skills\n# 上传 openclaw-gateway-fixer.zip\n```\n\n**或直接让 AI 使用：**\n> \"我的 OpenClaw 网页打不开，帮我诊断一下\"\n\nAI 会自动加载本技能并完整执行诊断修复流程。\n\n**手动运行脚本：**\n```powershell\n# 全面诊断\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File diagnose.ps1\n\n# 修复中文乱码\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File fix-gateway-cmd.ps1\n\n# 直接启动网关\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File start-gateway.ps1\n\n# 配置开机自启\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File setup-autostart.ps1\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 技术原理（给好奇的你）\n\nOpenClaw 在生成 `gateway.cmd` 启动脚本时，会将用户名写入文件。对于**中文 Windows 用户**，用户名包含多字节 UTF-8 字符，但 `gateway.cmd` 以 GBK（Windows 默认 ANSI 编码）保存，导致 UTF-8 字节被错误解释为 GBK，产生乱码（如 `鍚存竻鑳絓`），进而脚本执行路径错误，网关**静默启动失败**。\n\n本技能自动检测该编码错误，并以正确编码重写 `gateway.cmd`，同时对网关进程、端口占用、Node.js 路径等进行全面诊断。\n\n---\n\n## 📋 系统要求\n\n- Windows 10 / 11\n- OpenClaw 已安装（npm 全局安装）\n- Node.js 已安装\n- PowerShell 5.1+\n\n## 🏷️ 标签\n\n`OpenClaw` `Gateway` `Windows` `中文乱码` `开机自启` `端口18789` `故障诊断` `自动化`", "downloads": 108, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_711d6c08/openclaw-gateway-fixer", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a4e49550-e527-4406-b761-c4f2e607b757.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "OpenClaw故障自动诊断及修复工具", "ownerName": "user_711d6c08", "score": 20769.23076923077, "slug": "openclaw-gateway-fixer", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582992194, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.8.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780809454568, "description": "James Baldwin's The Fire Next Time — an executable toolkit for understanding race, justice, and the moral crisis of America through Baldwin's prophetic essay...", "description_zh": "詹姆斯·鲍德温的《下一次火灾》——通过其预言性散文，帮助理解美国种族、正义与道德危机的实用工具箱。", "downloads": 108, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/heardlyapp/the-fire-next-time", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 2, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "The Fire Next Time", "ownerName": "heardlyapp", "score": 13106.796116504855, "slug": "the-fire-next-time", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582990918, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claima